</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Let me show forth Thy beauty, Lord Jesus,</l><l>Like sunshine on the hills;</l><l>Oh, let my lips pour forth all Thy sweetness</l><l>In joyous sparkling rills.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Yes, like a channel, precious Lord Jesus,</l><l>Make me and let me be;</l><l>Keep me and use me daily, Lord Jesus,</l><l>For Thee, for only Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In all my heart and will, O Lord Jesus,</l><l>Be altogether king;</l><l>Make me a loyal subject, Lord Jesus,</l><l>To Thee in everything.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thirsting and hungering for Thee, Lord Jesus,</l><l>With blessed hunger here.</l><l>Longing for New Jerusalem’s fullness—</l><l>No thirst, no hunger there.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
